==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6~13.33 seconds<sup>180f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[R.Ost]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**10 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage introduces one new enemy, [[Pigeon de Sable]], which is used to support the R.Ost in this stage. Due to Pigeon de Sable's low damage, you can use long ranged attackers such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] or [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] along with other attackers such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon/King Dragon Cat]] or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris/Cyborg Cat]] to gradually damage R.Ost and kill Pigeon de Sables who enter your attacker's range.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]]: Both Crazed and normal Dragon Cats have powerful long-ranged shots perfect for damaging R. Ost. They may hit some of the peons, so bring [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] to help clear the way.
*[[Lifeguard Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Sweet Bro Cats]]: This trio's combination of Wave Immunity for the Pigeons and Slowing [[Traitless Enemies]] to stop R.Ost's pushing power is invaluable in a stage like this, as well has having solid DPS besides that.

